js-cfo-l0 = Gentle
js-cfo-l0-text = Only entries with exactly the same title, and events of the same category, get one shared colour – the one used most among them. Nothing is pulled apart.
js-cfo-l1 = Tidy
js-cfo-l1-text = Titles with the same word stem ("Holiday", "Holidays") and abbreviations ("OC" for "On call") belong together too. Nearly identical colours of different things are pulled apart.
js-cfo-l2 = Order
js-cfo-l2-text = Category, calendar and holidays set their family's colour instead of the majority. Colours that are hard to tell apart are pulled apart.
js-cfo-l3 = Balanced
js-cfo-l3-text = Like "Order", but colours that merely look alike are pulled apart as well. Fewer colours, all easy to tell apart.
js-cfo-l4 = Thorough
js-cfo-l4-text = Title series such as "Project: …" become one family too, unless two categories say otherwise. Pulled apart generously.
js-cfo-l5 = New palette
js-cfo-l5-text = Everything from "Thorough", and every family gets a new colour from professional palettes (Apple, Google Calendar) – as far apart as possible. Only calendars and holidays keep theirs. Changes the most.
